<form action="/permintaan" method="post" class="form inquiry-form"><div class="form-row"><label>Nama lengkap<input name="name" required maxlength="100" autocomplete="name" value="<%= user?.name||'' %>"></label><label>Email<input name="email" type="email" required maxlength="254" autocomplete="email" value="<%= user?.email||'' %>"></label></div><label>Firma / organisasi <span class="muted">(opsional)</span><input name="organization" maxlength="150" autocomplete="organization"></label><label>Keperluan<select name="type" required><% inquiryTypes.forEach(t=>{ %><option><%= t %></option><% }) %></select></label><label>Pesan<textarea name="message" rows="4" required minlength="10" maxlength="5000" placeholder="Ceritakan kebutuhan Anda secara singkat. Jangan sertakan data rahasia perkara."></textarea></label><div class="honeypot" aria-hidden="true"><label>Website<input name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></label></div><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="consent" value="yes" required><span>Saya menyetujui pengelolaan data untuk menindaklanjuti permintaan ini sesuai <a href="/privasi">kebijakan privasi</a>.</span></label><button class="button" type="submit">Kirim permintaan <span>↗</span></button><p class="form-note">Pengajuan ini tidak memungut biaya dan belum mengonfirmasi jadwal atau layanan.</p></form>
